' diagram-type: sequence
@startuml
title v0007-auth - canonical operator/team login and token issue

participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Canonical Auth State" as Auth

UI -> GW : login credentials
GW -> Auth : validate credentials and resolve\noperator + active team assignment
Auth --> GW : canonical operator_id, one team_id,\noptional team_name
alt missing or multiple active teams
  GW --> UI : reject; no token
else exactly one active team
  GW -> GW : issue signed token with operator_id,\nimmutable team_id, optional display-only team_name,\naudience, expiry
  GW --> UI : bearer token for API Gateway only
end

note over UI,GW
Refresh preserves the immutable team_id.
A changed/stale assignment requires a new login.
end note

@enduml
